# Video masters. Camera/export files are hundreds of megabytes - far past
# what GitHub accepts (100 MB) or the web host will serve (25 MB). Keep the
# master in cloud storage and commit only the compressed web versions
# (assets/hero.mp4 and assets/hero-mobile.mp4).
*.mov
*.MOV
assets/*-master.*
